+// Return length from here to next possible letter
+// On another < before >, return 1
+// advances <tag>
+//          |    |
+// advances <tag> ... </tag>  for <script> <style>
+//          |               |
+// advances <!-- ... <tag> ... -->
+//          |                     |
+// advances <tag
